{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22007","headline":"赠友五首 三 · 白居易","name":"赠友五首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"私家无钱炉，平地无铜山。\n胡爲秋夏税，岁岁输铜钱。\n钱力日已重，农力日已殚。\n贱粜粟与麦，贱贸丝与緜。\n岁暮衣食尽，焉得无饥寒。\n吾闻国之初，有制垂不刊。\n庸必算丁口，租必计桑田。\n不求土所无，不强人所难。\n量入以爲出，上足下亦安。\n兵兴一变法，兵息遂不还。\n使我农桑人，顦顇畎亩间。\n谁能革此弊，待君秉利权。\n复彼租庸法，令如贞观年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22007.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22007","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}